OL,3,GNEWSAWarrant for dad of A66 teen over
OL,4,Afuneral assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday Worthy failed to turn up for
OL,7,Fsentencing at Teesside Crown Court,
OL,8,Fwhich heard he had not spoken to his
OL,9,Fsolicitors or explained his absence to
OL,10,Fthe court.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
